  "created": "2026-11-20T10:58:33.91Z",
  "description": "ExpertPdf PDF to Image Converter renders the pages of PDF documents to images in memory or in files, at any resolution, in color or gray, and to multi-page TIFF documents.\n\nThis package contains the library for .NET Framework 2.0 to 4.8.1, .NET Core 2.0+ and .NET 5 to .NET 11 (through .NET Standard 2.0). It is the build for x86 and AnyCPU applications; for 64-bit applications use ExpertPdf.PdfToImage.x64.\n\nFeatures\n- Convert all pages or a range of pages to images\n- Any resolution; RGB or gray\n- PNG, JPEG, BMP, GIF and TIFF files, or System.Drawing images in memory\n- Multi-page TIFF documents\n- Password protected documents; document information",
  "iconFile": "images\\icon.jpg",
  "id": "ExpertPdf.PdfToImage",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-20T11:10:16.437Z",
